# Competitor and creator brief

Copy the prompt below and replace the [BRACKETS]. Read the README checks before using it.

```text
I want to learn from [CREATOR / PAGE LINK OR PASTED TEXT].
Do not copy their wording. Tell me:
1. What they offer, and to whom.
2. Their format (how the page or post is laid out) and why it works.
3. What is missing that Indian freelancers need.
